  "title": "Andreeva wins final seven games to beat Svitolina in FAGE WTA Finals debut",
  "description": "Mirra Andreeva's FAGE WTA Finals debut ended in a 6-4, 6-0 victory over Elina Svitolina on Monday at Indian Wells. The 19-year-old won the final seven games of the match to improve to 1-0 in Group 2 play and take a 2-1 lead in the head-to-head.",
